WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.459 --> 00:00:03.940
Let's go next to our caller from the two four
eight area code.

00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.430
Who's calling today from two four eight?

00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.720
Hi, Espace from Michigan.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:10.720
Hey.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.090
What's going on?

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:15.590
Hey, first of all, I love your show.

00:00:15.590 --> 00:00:19.470
I started watching it, listening to it about
a year ago.

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:20.470
Thank you.

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:22.499
I just want to say that.

00:00:22.499 --> 00:00:24.390
So I have two questions.

00:00:24.390 --> 00:00:30.970
One was related to your previous callers,
the Black Lives Movement.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:34.600
Back when it first started happened.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.250
George Floyd was killed.

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:45.579
I think the public, the majority of the public
had their support in terms of police reform.

00:00:45.579 --> 00:00:52.640
Now it seems like it's, you know, turning
into a very vague and.

00:00:52.640 --> 00:01:02.019
Doesn't really have a direction or specifics
of what the people want.

00:01:02.019 --> 00:01:09.909
And I don't know if that's going to be good
for the Democrats, especially coming into

00:01:09.909 --> 00:01:11.470
November.

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:19.909
In terms of getting rid of police or defending
all police and things like that, I was worrying

00:01:19.909 --> 00:01:24.580
if you can comment on that second question.

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:30.350
Yesterday, Biden at some event.

00:01:30.350 --> 00:01:34.370
Made a statement that he would reverse most
of Trump's tax cuts.

00:01:34.370 --> 00:01:35.370
Yeah.

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:43.570
How how much do you think that'll affect the
moderates in terms of their support for Biden?

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:47.759
Because I know they're probably more conservative
in terms of tax.

00:01:47.759 --> 00:01:52.640
I mean, no, nobody wants more taxes to pay
more taxes.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:57.909
Biden, you know, he's been doing great in
the polls nationally.

00:01:57.909 --> 00:02:03.670
And most states, especially, you know, the
swing states even I think today Texas, he's

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:05.420
even with Trump.

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:12.570
But do you think making any comments about
reversing tax cuts would be bad for him?

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:13.900
I mean, he's just staying.

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:14.900
Why?

00:02:14.900 --> 00:02:16.860
He's been doing great in the polls, just doing
nothing.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.330
But do you think that helps or hurts him?

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:24.180
I think that his comment about the tax cuts
is not going to have a big impact.

00:02:24.180 --> 00:02:31.360
I think that right now, really what you have
is a referendum on corona virus, a referendum

00:02:31.360 --> 00:02:37.830
on the economy as a result of corona virus,
a referendum on Trump's reaction to the protests,

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:42.360
which has been abysmal, and a referendum essentially
on Trump as the laughing stock around the

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:45.060
world that many believe him to be.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:50.750
So listen, Joe Biden has made it clear like
nothing is going to substantively change for

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:54.290
the privileged in the United States under
Joe Biden.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:56.140
So he'll reverse that.

00:02:56.140 --> 00:03:00.460
Trump's tack trump tax cuts or let certain
provisions expire.

00:03:00.460 --> 00:03:02.970
The very rich will pay a few points more.

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.290
But again, nothing will fundamentally change.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:08.030
It's these are really just slight tweaks.

00:03:08.030 --> 00:03:13.530
So I think at this point, because this is
such a referendum on Trump, I don't think

00:03:13.530 --> 00:03:18.450
that the tax cut comment is really going to
meet be a huge, different difference maker.

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:19.760
We'll see.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.210
As the new polls come out in the next seven
to 10 days.

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.700
Now, in terms of Black Lives Matter.

00:03:25.700 --> 00:03:30.310
I don't believe that what's going on with
Black Lives Matter is going to hurt Democrats

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:31.950
in November at all.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:38.580
I think, as you pointed out from the beginning,
on the main issue that re focused attention

00:03:38.580 --> 00:03:42.080
on Black Lives Matter right now, which were
the protests that started after the death

00:03:42.080 --> 00:03:44.170
of George Floyd.

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:49.050
Overwhelming support for police reform, reform,
support for Black Lives Matter itself is way

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:53.770
up compared to where it was, you know, two
months ago or just before the start of this.

00:03:53.770 --> 00:04:00.030
I think really the only risk is what we've
seen Republicans already try to do, which

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:07.760
is to couch the protesters as overwhelmingly
violent or criminal.

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:09.470
And it's mostly failed.

00:04:09.470 --> 00:04:13.310
I mean, like Trump and Kaylee McInerney, you
know, they keep pushing it.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:18.109
But I think people pretty much know at this
point that protesters are protesting and that's

00:04:18.109 --> 00:04:20.900
the majority of what's going on.

00:04:20.900 --> 00:04:25.340
And then other than that, you have other people
who are participating and doing bad acts,

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:27.110
but they're really not representative of the
movement.

00:04:27.110 --> 00:04:30.889
So, no, I don't think it's going to hurt Democrats
in November.

00:04:30.889 --> 00:04:33.550
OK, yeah, that makes sense.

00:04:33.550 --> 00:04:34.819
Oh, one last thing.

00:04:34.819 --> 00:04:39.939
And I've taken up a lot of time, but when
do you think Biden will announce a V.P.?

00:04:39.939 --> 00:04:44.539
I think it's it should should be obvious that
it's Kamala Harris.

00:04:44.539 --> 00:04:47.340
But, you know, I think she would be the best
bet.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:54.919
But would he wait until the you know, until
what's it called until the convention?

00:04:54.919 --> 00:04:55.919
Yeah.

00:04:55.919 --> 00:04:56.919
He said it'll be around.

00:04:56.919 --> 00:04:58.930
He's gonna announce around August 1st is what
he said.

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:01.259
So I would expect, you know, that's a month
away.

00:05:01.259 --> 00:05:04.009
I would expect that will be roughly around
that time.

00:05:04.009 --> 00:05:05.009
All right.

00:05:05.009 --> 00:05:06.009
Let's go to a quick break.

00:05:06.009 --> 00:05:10.229
If you're holding, don't hang up, because
I will go right back to the phones right after

00:05:10.229 --> 00:05:10.990
this short break.

